MTD	title	IDH1 and Glioma knockdown idh1
MTD	description	This study is a part of series performed for the same researcher through pilot/feasibility grant program, so the publication is relevant reference for other studies (ST000199)This specific experiment is a pilot study to compare the metabolism of cells transformed using empty vector against cells transformed with vector carrying short hairpin RNA (shRNA) targeted to silence isocitrate dehydrogenase-1 (IDH1) gene.
